  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2020-06-29",
   "text": "Protecting Renters from Eviction and Fees Act of 2020\n This bill expands the moratorium on evictions to include all tenants, as opposed to tenants of federally assisted properties, and extends the moratorium until March 27, 2021 (the current moratorium expires on July 25, 2020)."
  }
